Changes relative to AutoDock Vina 1.2.7:
- New files: src/lib/aco.h, src/lib/aco.cpp (ant colony optimization search).
- Modified: src/main/main.cpp (ACO, --ensemble, --mc_steps options), src/lib/vina.h, src/lib/vina.cpp,
  src/lib/monte_carlo.cpp, src/lib/model.h, src/lib/model.cpp, src/lib/bfgs.h,
  src/lib/quasi_newton.h, src/lib/quasi_newton.cpp, and speed changes described in docs/ALGORITHM.md.
- Added: CMakeLists.txt, build.sh, tools/, tests/, docs/ALGORITHM.md, example/aco_docking/.
- Removed: the Python bindings, the upstream build system and documentation sources, and the
  precomputed AutoDock4 maps of the examples.

example/aco_docking/ is derived from PDB entry 5S8I via the PoseBusters benchmark
(Buttenschoen, Morris & Deane, Chem. Sci. 2024, 15, 3130-3139).
